{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-48","kind":"proposition","title":"勾股定理的逆命题","englishTitle":"If in a triangle the square on one of the sides be equal to the squares on the remaining two sides of the triangle, the angle contained by the remaining two sides of the triangle is right.","book":1,"number":48,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":48,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","contentId":"euclid-1-48","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2faf8c1b65cb7ac61224c713ee21ed44abe92c9d2e7fbd503a14f2f57e03bf39","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-48.statement","euclid-1-48.proof.1","euclid-1-48.proof.2","euclid-1-48.construction.1","euclid-1-48.proof.3","euclid-1-48.construction.2","euclid-1-48.proof.4","euclid-1-48.proof.5","euclid-1-48.proof.6","euclid-1-48.conclusion","euclid-1-48.historical.1","euclid-1-48.historical.2","euclid-1-48.historical.3","euclid-1-48.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-48.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f2a1dc8431db17f6c538d158fb56a7d36c74da594e10f24985b4f5eff1f61aa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If in a triangle the square on one of the sides be equal to the squares on the remaining two sides of the triangle, the angle contained by the remaining two sides of the triangle is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在三角形中,一方的正方形等于三角形其余两侧的正方形,则三角形其余两侧形成的该角是直角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之一边上所作直角方形与馀边所作两直角方形并等，则对一边之角必直角。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"只要三角形一边的正方形与两边的正方形之和相等，则该边的角必为直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c9467b50e04d66169384282cf483350fea0e6990d86baec5a8825524352b5e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For in the triangle ABC let the square on one side BC be equal to the squares on the sides BA, AC;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形ABC, 一方正方形, 一方BC等于另一方正方形, BA, AC;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1bdd986ab69349e366c70d1ee1f9f3221744b5149e87fa0bbfc0faf8a7310ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angle BAC is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说BAC的该角是直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5daeed65cad4c437dc736f43458b3ae2adf481a4fcf091fe78c89fc49be9e594","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AD be drawn from the point A at right angles to the straight line AC, let AD be made equal to BA, and let DC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD从直角时的A点抽到AC线,AD等于BA,DC合二为一。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98b6284f61ae3fc06ebfd0b4d1b563cffffd2ff3a79772fa66d3737619f1c785","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since DA is equal to AB, the square on DA is also equal to the square on AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DA等于AB,DA等于正方形等于AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f3cc8f5efff2ced6b5e4560222558f446e752d59745fc7b48dfa642735a4999","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the square on AC be added to each; therefore the squares on DA, AC are equal to the squares on BA, AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC对AC对AC对DA对正方形对AC对AC等于BA对AC对AC对AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f67364ee167ad0fb96cc5f2f3d3af2dc6013cd1be8220c2cfaee83e5faccf4ea","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on DC is equal to the squares on DA, AC, for the angle DAC is right; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] and the square on BC is equal to the squares on BA, AC, for this is the hypothesis; therefore the square on DC is equal to the square on BC, so that the side DC is also equal to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DC比正方形等于DA比AC,DAC该角是直角;BC比正方形等于BA比正方形,AC,因为这是假设;因此DC等于BC比正方形,DC也等于BC。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b550c1d875129d2d09cd2066e361daaf667b40d5ed30518ac83489e77fe1f359","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DA is equal to AB, and AC is common, the two sides DA, AC are equal to the two sides BA, AC; and the base DC is equal to the base BC; therefore the angle DAC is equal to the angle BAC. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)] But the angle DAC is right; therefore the angle BAC is also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DA等于AB,AC是常见的,双方DA,AC等于双方BA,AC;底边,DC等于底边,BC;因此,DAC角等于BAC角,但DAC角是正确的;因此,BAC角也是正确的。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23f8925c3403a6f6f83479371c271c2e3a13a4d30dc57bc0062e5b41d26c0d0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之一边上所作直角方形与馀边所作两直角方形并等，则对一边之角必直角。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"只要三角形一边的正方形与两边的正方形之和相等，则该边的角必为直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"088282ca4e3b4b4d8982c2d6d9254860dd0d8f44df80cedb82f8377cb69f5638","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试于乙上作甲乙丁直角，而乙丁与乙丙两线等；次作丁甲线相联，其甲乙丁既直角，则甲丁上直角方形与甲乙、乙丁上两直角方形并等〈本篇四七〉。而甲乙、乙丁上两直角方形并与甲乙、乙丙上两直角方形并又等〈甲乙同乙丁乙丙等故〉，即丁甲上直角方形与甲丙上直角方形必等。夫甲乙丁角形之甲乙、乙丁两腰与甲乙丙角形之甲乙、乙丙两腰既等，而丁甲、甲丙两底又等，则对底线之两角亦等〈本篇八〉。甲乙丁既直角，即甲乙丙亦直角。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：在 乙 上向 甲乙丁 作一条直角线，且两条线 乙丁 和 乙丙 相等；接着，连接线 丁甲，由于 甲乙丁 是直角，因此 甲丁 上平方和 甲乙 和 乙丁 上的两个平方和等于 〈本篇四七〉。甲乙 和 乙丁 上的两个平方也等于 甲乙 和 乙丙 上的两个平方，这意味着 丁甲 上的平方与 甲丙 上的平方必须相等。如果三角形 甲乙丁、甲乙 和 乙丁 的两条直角边，以及三角形 甲乙丙 的三角形 甲乙 和 乙丙 的两条直角边相等，且 丁甲 和 甲丙 的底边也相等，那么底边的两个角也相等 〈本篇八〉。由于 甲乙丁 是直角，甲乙丙 也是直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"50b57a5c2152131b9a3a71844bd79abcb377b73f0e3bd94f42889da96a935ef7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"幾何原本卷一"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"原始几何学第一卷"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-48.source","contentId":"euclid-1-48","revisionId":"euclid-1-48@raw-2faf8c1b65cb7ac6","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c045f36117367ce76be4beeb3492f6b14a52e3e5713d3d71c8b47046123743d8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-48:euclid-1-47:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-48","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-48.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-47","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48/","sourceLabel":"I. 47"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-48:euclid-1-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-48","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-48.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.48/","sourceLabel":"I. 8"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-35:euclid-1-48:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-35","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-35.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-48","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.35","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.35/","sourceLabel":"I. 48"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-48:euclid-1-47:explicit","id":"euclid-1-47","book":1,"number":47,"kind":"proposition","title":"勾股定理：直角三角形斜边平方等于两直角边平方和","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-48:euclid-1-8:explicit","id":"euclid-1-8","book":1,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：三边分别相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-35:euclid-1-48:explicit","id":"euclid-11-35","book":11,"number":35,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平面与角与线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-triangle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
